Subject: rayecap: screen capture for Windows programs

A new dll that answers screen capture with the desktop's screens, through
the ScreenCast portal and PipeWire. The work is done by libraye-capture,
loaded with dlopen on first use, so Wine runs as before without it.
RayeCaptureDuplicateOutput() is a whole IDXGIOutputDuplication that only
uses the public D3D11 interface of the program's device: Wine's dxgi and
DXVK's dxgi both hand DuplicateOutput over to it.
